{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"08.03","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":66,"reply_count":24,"alternative_count":9,"total_audio_count":99,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"08.03.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"救命！","meaning_my":"ကယ်ကြပါဦး။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"帮我报警！","meaning_my":"ရဲကို အကြောင်းကြားပေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"发生什么事了？你在哪儿？","meaning_my":"ဘာဖြစ်တာလဲ၊ အခု ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"快帮我叫警察！","meaning_my":"ရဲကို အမြန်ခေါ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"请帮我打110。","meaning_my":"၁၁၀ ကို ဖုန်းဆက်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，我来报警。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ရဲကို ဖုန်းဆက်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"我要报警。","meaning_my":"ရဲတိုင်ချင်ပါတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"这里很危险！","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာ အန္တရာယ်ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先远离危险的地方。","meaning_my":"အန္တရာယ်ရှိတဲ့နေရာကနေ အရင်ဝေးဝေးနေပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"这里有人打架！","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ လူတွေ ရန်ဖြစ်နေကြတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"有人偷东西！","meaning_my":"ပစ္စည်းခိုးနေတဲ့သူ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S007_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这里有人在偷东西！","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ ပစ္စည်းခိုးနေတဲ့သူ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S007_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"我的包被抢了。","meaning_my":"အိတ် လုယူခံလိုက်ရတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"你受伤了吗？","meaning_my":"ဒဏ်ရာရသွားလား။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我的手机被偷了。","meaning_my":"ဖုန်း ခိုးခံလိုက်ရတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"有人偷了我的手机。","meaning_my":"တစ်ယောက်ယောက်က ဖုန်းကို ခိုးသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"我的护照被偷了！","meaning_my":"ပတ်စ်ပို့ ခိုးခံလိုက်ရတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先报警，再联系相关使领馆。","meaning_my":"ရဲကို အရင်တိုင်ပြီး သက်ဆိုင်ရာသံရုံး ဒါမှမဟုတ် ကောင်စစ်ဝန်ရုံးကို ဆက်သွယ်ပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"我的钱包丢了。","meaning_my":"ပိုက်ဆံအိတ် ပျောက်သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"我的证件丢了。","meaning_my":"အထောက်အထားစာရွက်စာတမ်း ပျောက်သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"有人跟踪我。","meaning_my":"တစ်ယောက်ယောက် နောက်က လိုက်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"有人威胁我！","meaning_my":"တစ်ယောက်ယောက်က ခြိမ်းခြောက်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"我在商场门口。","meaning_my":"ဈေးဝယ်စင်တာ အဝင်ပေါက်မှာ ရှိနေတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S015_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"请说一下商场的名字。","meaning_my":"ဈေးဝယ်စင်တာ နာမည်ကို ပြောပြပေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S015_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我不知道这里的地址。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာရဲ့ လိပ်စာကို မသိဘူး။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S016_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"看看旁边有没有明显的地标。","meaning_my":"ဘေးနားမှာ ထင်ရှားတဲ့ အဆောက်အအုံ ဒါမှမဟုတ် အမှတ်အသား ရှိမရှိ ကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S016_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"那个人还在附近。","meaning_my":"အဲဒီလူ ဒီနားမှာ ရှိနေသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不要追他，先保护自己。","meaning_my":"သူ့နောက် မလိုက်ပါနဲ့၊ ကိုယ့်လုံခြုံရေးကို အရင်ဂရုစိုက်ပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"他往那边跑了。","meaning_my":"သူ ဟိုဘက်ကို ပြေးသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"他穿黑色衣服。","meaning_my":"သူ အနက်ရောင်အဝတ်အစား ဝတ်ထားတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"我的包里有护照和钱。","meaning_my":"အိတ်ထဲမှာ ပတ်စ်ပို့နဲ့ ပိုက်ဆံ ပါတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S021","kind":"main","cn":"这里有监控吗？","meaning_my":"ဒီမှာ CCTV ကင်မရာ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S022","kind":"main","cn":"警察什么时候到？","meaning_my":"ရဲတွေ ဘယ်တော့ ရောက်မလဲ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"请在安全的地方等警察。","meaning_my":"လုံခြုံတဲ့နေရာမှာ ရဲလာတာကို စောင့်ပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S022_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S023","kind":"main","cn":"我需要翻译。","meaning_my":"ဘာသာပြန်ပေးမယ့်သူ လိုပါတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S023_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我帮你问问有没有翻译人员。","meaning_my":"ဘာသာပြန်ပေးမယ့်သူ ရှိမရှိ မေးပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S023_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S023_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"能找个人帮我翻译吗？","meaning_my":"ဘာသာပြန်ပေးမယ့်သူ တစ်ယောက် ရှာပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S023_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S024","kind":"main","cn":"我听不懂，请说慢点。","meaning_my":"နားမလည်လို့ နည်းနည်း ဖြည်းဖြည်း ပြောပေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S024_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，我说慢一点。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ နည်းနည်း ဖြည်းဖြည်း ပြောမယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S024_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S025","kind":"main","cn":"请别挂电话！","meaning_my":"ဖုန်းမချပါနဲ့ဦး။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S026","kind":"main","cn":"我现在安全了。","meaning_my":"အခု လုံခြုံတဲ့နေရာမှာ ရောက်နေပြီ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S026.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S027","kind":"main","cn":"我需要一份报警记录。","meaning_my":"ရဲတိုင်ထားတဲ့ မှတ်တမ်းစာရွက်တစ်စောင် လိုပါတယ်။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S027.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S027_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"请向受理案件的警察咨询办理方式。","meaning_my":"အမှုလက်ခံတဲ့ ရဲကို ဘယ်လိုထုတ်ယူရမလဲ မေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S027_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S028","kind":"main","cn":"能开丢失证明吗？","meaning_my":"ပစ္စည်းပျောက်ဆုံးကြောင်း ထောက်ခံစာ ထုတ်ပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S029","kind":"main","cn":"请帮我联系大使馆。","meaning_my":"သံရုံးကို ဆက်သွယ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.01-S030","kind":"main","cn":"后续怎么跟进？","meaning_my":"နောက်ထပ် ဘယ်လို ဆက်လက်မေးမြန်းရမလဲ။","audio_file":"08.03.01-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S001","kind":"main","cn":"快叫救护车！","meaning_my":"လူနာတင်ကား အမြန်ခေါ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"有人受伤吗？在哪里？","meaning_my":"ဒဏ်ရာရသူ ရှိလား၊ ဘယ်မှာလဲ။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"快帮我叫救护车！","meaning_my":"လူနာတင်ကား အမြန် ခေါ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"请帮我打120。","meaning_my":"၁၂၀ ကို ဖုန်းဆက်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"请告诉我具体位置。","meaning_my":"နေရာကို အတိအကျ ပြောပြပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"有人昏倒了！","meaning_my":"လူတစ်ယောက် မေ့လဲသွားပြီ။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"他有反应吗？还在呼吸吗？","meaning_my":"သူ တုံ့ပြန်သေးလား၊ အသက်ရှူနေသေးလား။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S004","kind":"main","cn":"他没有反应。","meaning_my":"သူ့ကို ခေါ်ကြည့်ပေမယ့် တုံ့ပြန်မှု မရှိဘူး။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S004_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"怎么叫他都叫不醒！","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လိုခေါ်ခေါ် မနိုးဘူး။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S004_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"他没有正常呼吸！","meaning_my":"သူ ပုံမှန်အတိုင်း အသက်မရှူတော့ဘူး။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.03.02-S005_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"立刻打急救电话，按接线员指导做。","meaning_my":"အရေးပေါ်ဖုန်းကို ချက်ချင်းဆက်ပြီး ဖုန်းလက်ခံသူ ညွှန်ကြားတဲ့အတိုင်း လုပ်ပါ။","audio_file":"08.03.02-S005_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"08.0